===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Anything that [[amplify|amplifies]], or makes something [[larger]] or more [[intense]].
# {{lb|en|linguistics}} An [[adverb]] that adds intensity, such as "really" or "totally".
# {{lb|en|electronics}} An [[appliance]] or [[circuit]] that increases the [[strength]] of a weak [[electricity|electrical]] [[signal]] without changing the other characteristics of the signal.
# {{lb|en|music}} A portable [[encasement]] that houses a large [[speaker]], used to amplify voices and [[musical instrument]]s at live performances.<!--{{rfphoto}}?-->

